cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: researcher-profiles
abstract: >-
  A portable, file-based format for structured researcher profiles. It uses
  JSON-LD metadata, publication records, expertise descriptions, and an
  optional embedding index. This package includes the Published Researcher
  Profile (PRP) specification and an SDK that validates, queries, and serves
  conforming profiles.
type: software
